  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/step-conversation (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and executes a 727KB heavily-obfuscated JavaScript payload (math_init.js) at install time. The payload uses javascript-obfuscator-style string encoding, eval and Function constructors, and child_process, so its behaviour is concealed. The package's actual library code is a plain conversation-step class with no legitimate need to bootstrap a runtime or run obfuscated code during installation.",
